{'symbol': 'CMG', 'date': '2023-02-15 08:02:00', 'title': 'CHIPOTLE INTRODUCES NEW CALIFORNIA INSPIRED FRESH EATERY CONCEPT, FARMESA', 'text': "FARMESA FEATURES A ROBUST, CUSTOMIZABLE MENU OF FRESH INGREDIENTS SERVED IN BOWLS IN PARTNERSHIP WITH KITCHEN UNITED MIX, FARMESA IS OPENING AT SANTA MONICA'S THIRD STREET PROMENADE IN SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA FARMESA WILL HELP CHIPOTLE TEST AND LEARN ON FUTURE RESTAURANT CONCEPTS \xa0 NEWPORT BEACH, CALIF. , FEB. 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHIPOTLE MEXICAN GRILL (NYSE: CMG) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS OPENING A NEW RESTAURANT CALLED FARMESA AT THIRD STREET PROMENADE IN SANTA MONICA, CALIFORNIA."}